1
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:16,000
They were searching for proof... they found it.

2
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:26,000
Grave Encounters is a thriller, horror film directed by Stuart Ortiz.

3
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
A crew from a paranormal reality television show lock
themselves in a haunted psychiatric hospital.

4
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:46,000
They search for evidence of paranormal activity as they shoot
what ends up becoming their final episode.

5
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:56,000
Lance Preston, played by Sean Rogerson.

6
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,000
Sasha Parker, played by Ashleigh Gryzko.

7
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:16,000
T.C. Gibson, played by Merwin Mondesir.

8
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Houston Gray, played by Mackenzie Gray.

9
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Matt White, played by Juan Riedinger.

10
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:46,000
Dr. Arthur Friedkin, played by Arthur Corber.

11
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:56,000
Grave Encounters is a 2011 Canadian found footage supernatural horror
film written and directed by the Vicious Brothers.

12
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
The film stars Sean Rogerson, Ashleigh Gryzko, Merwin Mondesir, Mackenzie Gray, and Juan Riedinger as the crew of a successful paranormal reality television series who lock
themselves in a supposedly haunted psychiatric hospital to search for evidence of paranormal activity as they shoot what ends up becoming the series' final episode.

13
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:16,000
Grave Encounters premiered on April 22, 2011, at the Tribeca Film Festival and was released through video on
demand, with a simultaneous limited theatrical release in the United States, on August 25, 2011.

14
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:26,000
It was a commercial success, grossing over $5 million against a
$120,000 budget, and received mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
The film has garnered a cult following since its
release, with a sequel released in 2012.

16
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:46,000
The film explores themes of haunting, insane asylum,
paranormal, psychiatric hospital, ghost hunting.

17
01:27:50,000 --> 01:27:56,000
The tone is dark and intense.
